{"seq":2,"slug":"sync-lag-oversell","title":"同步延迟导致的跨平台超卖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-inventory-sync-platform/sync-consistency/sync-lag-oversell","wordCount":3012,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"同步延迟导致的跨平台超卖\">同步延迟导致的跨平台超卖</h1><p>超卖这件事在单渠道系统里已经被解决得很好：数据库行锁、条件更新、乐观并发，都能保证「卖了 100 件就真的只有 100 件」。跨平台超卖之所以难，是因为参与方各自都是对的——每个渠道都原子地扣减了自己的本地库存，都遵循了正确的并发控制，但把它们的决策合起来看，总量超了。这是一个分布式系统里的经典问题：<strong>每个节点局部正确，全局错误</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>超卖的根源是<strong>决策依据的过期</strong>。渠道 A 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 读到可用量 1，渠道 B 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0 + 50\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 也读到可用量 1（因为 A 的扣减事件还没到达 B），两者都在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0 + 60\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 完成了本地扣减。总卖出 2 件，实际只有 1 件。这不是谁做错了，而是信息在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0 + 50\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间没有传播。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as 渠道 A&#10;    participant C as 库存中台&#10;    participant B as 渠道 B&#10;    Note over C: available = 1&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;C: 读取可售量&#10;    C--&gt;&gt;A: 1(快照时刻 t0)&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;C: 读取可售量&#10;    C--&gt;&gt;B: 1(快照时刻 t0,A 的扣减未达)&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: 本地扣减成功&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: 本地扣减成功&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;C: 上报扣减 1&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;C: 上报扣减 1&#10;    Note over C: 收到 2 件扣减,实际只有 1\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as 渠道 A\n    participant C as 库存中台\n    participant B as 渠道 B\n    Note over C: available = 1\n    A-&gt;&gt;C: 读取可售量\n    C--&gt;&gt;A: 1(快照时刻 t0)\n    B-&gt;&gt;C: 读取可售量\n    C--&gt;&gt;B: 1(快照时刻 t0,A 的扣减未达)\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: 本地扣减成功\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: 本地扣减成功\n    A-&gt;&gt;C: 上报扣减 1\n    B-&gt;&gt;C: 上报扣减 1\n    Note over C: 收到 2 件扣减,实际只有 1</pre><p>超卖的规模由两个量共同决定：<strong>同步延迟</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 和<strong>并发竞争强度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>。在延迟窗口内，每个渠道都会尝试扣减，窗口内的总尝试量决定了最坏超卖量。用一个简化的模型看：如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个渠道在延迟窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 内各自尝试扣减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 件，而窗口开始时可用量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，那么超卖的期望规模近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>oversell</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>窗口内竞争</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{oversell}] \\approx \\max\\left(0,\\ n \\cdot k \\cdot \\mathbb{P}(\\text{窗口内竞争}) - a\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">oversell</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">窗口内竞争</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个模型的价值不在于精确预测，而在于指出可操作的杠杆：降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>（减少窗口）、降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（减少同时竞争的渠道数）、降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（限制单次扣减批量）、提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>（保留缓冲）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓解手段</th>\n<th>作用对象</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缩短同步延迟</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>基础设施成本、事件合并窗口变小导致写放大</td>\n<td>目录小、变动密集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道级封顶</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\cdot k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>渠道可售量被人为压低，少卖</td>\n<td>渠道数多、同步链路长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓冲区（安全水位）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>恒定的证据性少卖</td>\n<td>通用，最易实施</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次扣减批量上限</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大额订单被拆分或拒绝</td>\n<td>有批发渠道时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预占式下单</td>\n<td>决策时机</td>\n<td>下单链路延迟上升</td>\n<td>高价值商品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>缓冲区</strong>是最通用的手段，它的逻辑是：不把全部可用量暴露给渠道，而是保留一部分作为「不可见的缓冲」，只有中心知道。渠道看到 100 件只卖出 87 件时，剩下的 13 件永远不展示，于是延迟窗口内的竞争只在 87 件上发生。缓冲量的计算需要知道延迟和竞争强度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mtext>demand during </mtext><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = z \\cdot \\sigma_{\\text{demand during } L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">demand during </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是延迟窗口内需求波动的标准差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 由可接受超卖率决定（对应服务水平）。这个公式的形态与 <a href=\"../allocation-rebalance/safety-stock-region\">分区域安全库存模型</a> 中的安全库存公式同构——本质都是「用缓冲吸收不可预测的波动」，区别只在缓冲的对象是补货提前期还是同步延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道级封顶与配额的关系\">渠道级封顶与配额的关系</h2><p>渠道级封顶是给每个渠道设定一个<strong>本地上限</strong>，渠道在达到上限后停止展示和售卖，即使中台知道自己还有货。它把超卖控制在「所有渠道上限之和超出实际库存」的范围内：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>oversell</mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{oversell}_{\\max} = \\sum_{c=1}^{n} \\text{cap}_c - a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">oversell</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子说明封顶的松紧直接决定超卖上界。如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{cap}_c = a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，理论上不会超卖（但会造成少卖，因为某个渠道用不完自己的份额）。如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{cap}_c = 1.2a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，就允许 20% 的超卖风险换取更高的售罄率。这个 20% 是业务参数，不是技术参数——它应该由「超卖的赔付成本」和「少卖的毛利损失」的相对大小决定，并且要写进可观测指标而非留在某人的脑子里。</p>\n<p>封顶与 <a href=\"../multi-channel-pool/shared-vs-allocated\">共享库存 vs 渠道分配库存</a> 的分配池在形态上相似（都是给渠道一个有限的量），但意图不同：分配池是为了隔离渠道、保证承诺；封顶是为了防止延迟造成的超卖，它是一个防御措施而非分配策略。两者可以叠加——在分配池之上再加一层封顶，封顶值低于配额值，留出延迟缓冲。</p>\n<p>封顶的动态调整需要小心翼翼。收紧封顶（降低 cap）可以在检测到延迟上升时立刻生效，因为它只减少渠道可卖量，是保守方向；放宽封顶则必须等延迟恢复到正常水平并持续一段时间，因为放宽的瞬间所有渠道的本地余量会同时增加，如果延迟仍然很高，超卖会立刻发生。这是一个不对称的调节：<strong>收紧即时、放宽滞后</strong>，和 TCP 拥塞控制里的原则一脉相承。TCP 的拥塞窗口在检测到丢包时立即减半（乘法减小，<code>ssthresh = max(FlightSize / 2, 2*SMSS)</code>），而在无拥塞时按每 RTT 线性加一逐步逼近（加法增大），这个 AIMD 模式正是「快速后退、缓慢恢复」的标准形态（来源：RFC 5681 TCP Congestion Control, <a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5681）。\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5681）。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"降级与止损\">降级与止损</h2><p>当延迟突破阈值时，系统需要一套有序的降级动作，而不是等到超卖发生。降级的层级通常是：</p>\n<p>第一层是<strong>降低发布频率的合并</strong>——把事件合并窗口从 1 秒拉长到 5 秒，减少总线压力。这会延长延迟，但在上游过载时反而是必要的，因为不合并的后果是积压更深。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>冻结部分渠道的新增展示</strong>——停止向最慢的渠道推送新的可售量，让它维持在上一个已知值。这防止了「基于过期数据的展示继续吸引买家」。</p>\n<p>第三层是<strong>切换到保守模式</strong>——所有渠道统一使用一个保守的可售量（如中心可用量的 70%），牺牲利用率换取确定性。</p>\n<p>第四层是<strong>局部停售</strong>——对受影响最严重的 SKU 停止接单，直到延迟恢复。这是最贵的动作，因为它直接损失销售，但因为超卖的代价（退款、赔付、平台处罚、用户信任）通常更高，它是合理的最后手段。</p>\n<p>降级的触发要基于延迟指标而不是超卖指标，因为超卖是结果——等到超卖发生再降级就太晚了。延迟指标的度量口径见 <a href=\"../sync-platform-ops/sync-monitoring-alert\">同步延迟/差异监控告警</a>。同时降级动作应该是自动的但可观测的：每一次降级都要记录触发原因、影响范围、持续时长，否则系统会在降级状态下静默运行数周而无人知晓（这是真实事故里非常常见的形态）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟的可观测定义与预算\">延迟的可观测定义与预算</h2><p>超卖治理的前提是延迟可被度量，而「同步延迟」这个词在实践中至少有五种不同口径，混用会造成严重的误判：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>度量对象</th>\n<th>典型量级</th>\n<th>误用后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件产生延迟</td>\n<td>业务写入到事件发布</td>\n<td>生产者</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>忽略它会把生产者故障误判为网络问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输延迟</td>\n<td>发布到消费者收到</td>\n<td>消息总线</td>\n<td>毫秒到秒</td>\n<td>长尾（P99）比均值重要得多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费延迟</td>\n<td>收到到应用完成</td>\n<td>消费者</td>\n<td>毫秒到秒</td>\n<td>消费者落后是积压的根因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端可见延迟</td>\n<td>业务写入到渠道可售量更新</td>\n<td>全链路</td>\n<td>秒到分钟</td>\n<td>唯一对业务有意义的数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积压深度</td>\n<td>未消费事件数</td>\n<td>总线</td>\n<td>条数</td>\n<td>是延迟的先行指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>真正需要被 SLO 约束的是<strong>端到端可见延迟</strong>，因为它是买家实际感受到的那个数。前四个口径是诊断用的分解，用于在端到端延迟超标时定位是哪一段贡献了延迟。把「积压深度」当作先行指标尤其重要——积压深度上升而端到端延迟还没恶化，这是系统仍在追赶、尚未失控的时刻，也是唯一的干预窗口；等到端到端延迟也上去了，积压通常已经深到需要数小时才能消化。</p>\n<p>延迟预算（latency budget）把端到端 SLO 拆到各段，让每一段有明确的改善目标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>e2e</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>produce</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>transport</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>consume</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>view</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>SLO</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{e2e}} = L_{\\text{produce}} + L_{\\text{transport}} + L_{\\text{consume}} + L_{\\text{view}} \\le L_{\\text{SLO}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">e2e</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">produce</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transport</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">consume</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">view</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SLO</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一个具体的拆法是在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>SLO</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{SLO}} = 5\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SLO</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span> 下给生产者 200ms、传输 500ms、消费 1s、视图缓存 3s。这个预算的用处是让讨论变得可操作：当端到端超标时，看是哪一段超了自己的份额，而不是笼统地说「同步慢」。视图缓存段占用最多预算（3s）是合理的，因为缓存是主动选择的取舍（见 <a href=\"../multi-channel-pool/global-available-view\">全球可售视图聚合</a>），而前三段是被动的基础设施开销。</p>\n<p>延迟的分布远比均值重要。同步延迟是典型的重尾分布：P50 可能是 300ms，而 P99 到了 8s，超卖几乎全部发生在尾部。因此 SLO 必须以分位数表达（如「P99 端到端延迟 &lt; 5s」），而告警也应该基于分位数而非均值。用平均延迟做告警的经典失败是：99% 的请求在 200ms 完成，1% 卡了 30s，平均值仍然是 500ms 看着很健康，但每天有数万次扣减发生在 30s 的过期数据上。Google SRE 对此有明确结论：「Most metrics are better thought of as distributions rather than averages」、「it&#39;s entirely possible for most of the requests to be fast, but for a long tail of requests to be much, much slower」，并且「Monitoring and alerting based only on the average latency would show no change in behavior over the course of the day」（来源：Google SRE Book, Ch.4 Service Level Objectives, <a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/service-level-objectives/）。分位数的选择要与业务匹配——P99\">https://sre.google/sre-book/service-level-objectives/）。分位数的选择要与业务匹配——P99</a> 适用于高频 SKU，低频长尾 SKU 的 P99 样本量不足，改用「超过阈值的事件占比」这类计数型指标更稳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨平台超卖不是谁的实现错了，而是<strong>每个节点局部正确、全局错误</strong>——决策依据在延迟窗口内过期。</li>\n<li>超卖规模由延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、竞争渠道数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、单次扣减批量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>、可用量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 共同决定；四个量都是可操作杠杆。</li>\n<li>缓冲区（安全水位）是最通用的手段，公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = z \\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 与安全库存同构；渠道级封顶则给出超卖上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{cap}_c - a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>封顶的松紧是业务参数（超卖赔付成本 vs 少卖毛利损失），必须写进可观测指标而非留在个人经验里。</li>\n<li>封顶与分配池形态相似意图不同；封顶是延迟防御，两者可叠加，封顶值低于配额值。</li>\n<li>封顶调节遵循「收紧即时、放宽滞后」的不对称原则，放宽前必须确认延迟已持续恢复。</li>\n<li>降级分四层递进：延长合并窗口、冻结慢渠道展示、切保守模式、局部停售；触发依据是延迟指标而非超卖结果。</li>\n<li>降级必须自动但可观测，记录触发原因与持续时长，避免系统静默长期处于降级状态。</li>\n<li>「同步延迟」有五种口径，需 SLO 约束的是端到端可见延迟，其余四种用于诊断分解；积压深度是唯一的先行指标。</li>\n<li>延迟预算是可操作的沟通工具（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>e2e</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>SLO</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{e2e}} = \\sum L_i \\le L_{\\text{SLO}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">e2e</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SLO</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），端到端超标时先定位哪一段超了自己的份额。</li>\n<li>同步延迟是重尾分布，SLO 与告警必须用分位数；平均延迟会把「99% 快、1% 极慢」的系统显示为健康。度量实现见 <a href=\"../sync-platform-ops/sync-monitoring-alert\">同步延迟/差异监控告警</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"同步延迟导致的跨平台超卖","id":"同步延迟导致的跨平台超卖"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道级封顶与配额的关系","id":"渠道级封顶与配额的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"降级与止损","id":"降级与止损"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟的可观测定义与预算","id":"延迟的可观测定义与预算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"库存事件驱动同步与对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-inventory-sync-platform/sync-consistency/event-driven-sync"},"next":{"title":"跨渠道预占协调与防重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-inventory-sync-platform/sync-consistency/reservation-reservation"}}